#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:322
msgid "Bridges fan speed"
msgstr "桥接风扇速度"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:327
msgid "This fan speed is enforced during all bridges and overhangs."
msgstr "此风扇速度在所有桥和悬空期间强制执行。"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:336
msgid "Bridge flow ratio"
msgstr "桥接流量比"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:341
msgid ""
"This factor affects the amount of plastic for bridging. You can decrease it "
"slightly to pull the extrudates and prevent sagging, although default "
"settings are usually good and you should experiment with cooling (use a fan) "
"before tweaking this."
msgstr ""
"此因子影响用于桥接的耗材量。您可以稍微减小它挤出和防止下垂，虽然默认设置通常"
"很好，您应该尝试冷却（使用风扇），然后再调整它。"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:352
msgid "Single perimeter on top surfaces"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:357
msgid ""
"Use only one perimeter on flat top surface, to give more space to the top "
"infill pattern. Could be applied on topmost surface or all top surfaces."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:361
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:2487
msgid "All top surfaces"
msgstr "所有顶面"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:362
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:2488
